{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>BURN BRIGHTER!! INITIATE DRY CONTACT!! 30 bosses await in the insurmountable  run-and-gun</i>!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462730/extras/615b37149d38990361b73d79ad0a5144.poster.avif?t=1759506358\" width=590 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462730/extras/615b37149d38990361b73d79ad0a5144.webm?t=1759506358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462730/extras/615b37149d38990361b73d79ad0a5144.mp4?t=1759506358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>----- STORY -----</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Earth reaches the precipice of apocalypse, a lone boy with vengeful eyes rushes towards <strong><u>KaiserCorps</u></strong>, the leading authority on weapons technologies and the epicenter of an alien rampage. Discover the backstory of <strong><u>Geverel</u></strong>, the hollow soldier, through non-linear storytelling with comic-style art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>----- GAMEPLAY -----</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burst through 8 stages, each loaded with 1-on-1 duels against KaiserCorps' insane experiments and top infantry. Go blazing with 4 different types of guns, then slam a centrifuge of raw energy into your enemies with the <strong><u>Tatsujin Punch</u></strong> and <u>Ignition Dash Explosion.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(<strong>Disaster Arms</strong> is intended to be played in one sitting with limited continues like an arcade game - however, an unlimited continue mode is provided for casual and newcoming players.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>----- FEATURES -----</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>30 bosses</u></strong> - from giant machine-monster hybrids, to your vengeful soldier brethren</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Shmup/Bullet Hell</u></strong> design philosophy meets action platformer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish artstyle and <strong><u>multi-sprite animation</u></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Strafe-based shooting</u></strong> controls let you evade while keeping your aim on the target</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strike enemy weakpoints for <strong><u>maximum damage</u></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct pre-apocalypse setting: Prevent the incoming dystopia!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Original soundtrack composed using YM2612+SN76489</u></strong>, the signature sound hardware of the 16-bit MD/GEN consoles</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"DEFEAT_SUBCLASS_13","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3462730/8242c7c8db1ab80e9d4b3681d34820958c7e9110.jpg"},{"name":"DEFEAT_SUBCLASS_23","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3462730/b5de5e4a113f7fa0f0580408767dbd34436ca9f4.jpg"},{"name":"DEFEAT_SUBCLASS_34","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3462730/a1dda932f58df81e674e2f6c2ec2155cc819b70c.jpg"},{"name":"DEFEAT_SUBCLASS_43","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3462730/5b7d9b705604a07d554c62a720fa8c30ee511b17.jpg"},{"name":"DEFEAT_SUBCLASS_53","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3462730/23f3397f6f893ffa2836936feb851bc5b64194c7.jpg"},{"name":"DEFEAT_SUBCLASS_64","path":"https://cdn.akamai.ste